     "AB2-10.2-01",
     "AB2-1.3-03",
     "AB2-3-01",
     "AB2-3-09"
    ],
    "equivalent": false,
    "reason": "When extra latency is drawn, the pending flag is never set, so the delayed value is never applied to sim_cur and the req/ack crossing is stuck and the transfer never completes."
   },
   "M05": {
    "rules": [
     "AB2-1.3-06",
     "AB2-3-42",
     "AB2-10.2-06",
     "AB2-6.3-13",
     "AB2-6.3-14"
    ],
    "equivalent": false,
    "reason": "In APB5 the wake-up sampling is inverted: reg_wakeup is 0 when the APB5 parameter is 1, so i_apb_pwakeup is never forwarded to o_apb_pwakeup. The sync of the requester wake-up is lost; only the in-progress term remains."
   },
   "M06": {
    "rules": [
     "AB2-7.3-04",
     "AB2-7.2-04",
     "AB2-10.2-08",
     "AB2-15.3-18",
     "AB2-3-37"
    ],
    "equivalent": false,
    "reason": "The reset value of the pending flag becomes 1, so after reset release the model loads the uninitialised sim_nxt into sim_cur, giving X or a spurious request/ack on the sync output and a spurious transfer or X after reset."
   },
   "M07": {
    "rules": [
