     "AB2-1.3-03",
     "AB2-1.3-05"
    ],
    "equivalent": false,
    "reason": "The extra-latency counter test is inverted: an extra delay of 1 is applied one cycle late and an extra delay of 2 is applied one cycle early, so the random crossing latency changes cycle by cycle but stays within the allowed window, which is why no check kills it."
   },
